Package: Datacleaner
Title: Cleans Data for Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Colden", "Deitch", email = "cdeitch@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package will be used by analysts who are trying to clean data.
    It will include functions to check for and remove outliers, handle missing
    data, and allow for seamless data manipulation.
